[0.0, "m", "2. Ready for Implementation Prompt"]
[1.0, "o", "\u001b[?2026hImplement @[docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md] in `xiao-rp2350-bargraph/`, keeping `nuttx/` and `apps/`\r\n  submodules completely unmodified. After creating the files, run `make -C xiao-rp2350-bargraph test` and `make -C\u001b[K\r\n  xiao-rp2350-bargraph` and verify `nuttx/nuttx.uf2` builds cleanly and `git -C nuttx status -s` / `git -C apps status\u001b[K\r\n  -s` show zero tracked modifications.\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90C\u001b[33mauto\u001b[39;2m · Gemini 4 Argon · medium\r\u001b[m\u001b[2A\u001b[38C\u001b[?2026l"]
