[0.051, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[33A\u001b[K\n  The \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-bargraph\u001b[m files have been created and \u001b[94mmake -C xiao-rp2350-bargraph test\u001b[m passed. The firmware build\u001b[K\r\n  (\u001b[94mmake -C xiao-rp2350-bargraph\u001b[m) is now running in the background (\u001b[94mRegister: bargraph\u001b[m); I will wait for it to finish\r\n  and then verify \u001b[94mnuttx/nuttx.uf2\u001b[m and the submodule \u001b[94mgit status\u001b[m checks.\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 1m 2s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(Initial hypothesis: examining the Git status of NuttX and apps repositories. Running `git stat...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m 2 commands \u001b[37m(ls -lh nuttx/nuttx n...: failed · find xiao-rp2350-bar...)\u001b[m\n\u001b[74D\u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(.gitignore)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m 2 commands \u001b[37m(git -C nuttx status -s · git -C apps status -s)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  The out-of-tree Seeed Studio XIAO RP2350 6-segment PWM LED bar graph design in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkde0453dd6892030e;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md\u0007docs/designs/xi"]
