[0.0, "m", "6. Breadboard Wiring & SVG Complete — Ready for Commit Prompt"]
[1.0, "o", "\u001b[?2026hVerify `git -C nuttx status -s` and `git -C apps status -s` are clean, stage `xiao-rp2350-bargraph/` and the\r\n  generated breadboard wiring Markdown and SVG files, and `git commit`.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90C\u001b[33mauto\u001b[39;2m · Gemini 4 Argon · medium\r\u001b[m\u001b[2A\u001b[71C\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.0, "m", "7. Prompt: Verify Submodules & Commit Implementation"]
[0.2, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\n\n\u001b[J\u001b[3A\u001b[2C\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[89C\u001b[1K \u001b[33mauto\u001b[39;2m · Gemini 4 Argon · medium\r\u001b[m\u001b[2A\u001b[2C\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.018, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[32A\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[1m### \u001b[m\u001b[1mVerification\u001b[m\u001b[1m Results\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\n  • \u001b[94mmake -C xiao-rp2350-bargraph test\u001b[m: Passed (\u001b[94mbargraph unit tests passed\u001b[m).\r\n  • \u001b[94mmake -C xiao-rp2350-bargraph\u001b[m: Configured \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-bargraph:bargraph\u001b[m, registered the built-in \u001b[94mbargraph\u001b[m app, and\r\n  generated \u001b[94mnuttx/nuttx\u001b[m, \u001b[94mnuttx/nuttx.bin\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mnuttx/nuttx.uf2\u001b[m (\u001b[94m177,232 B\u001b[m FLASH / \u001b[94m13,712 B\u001b[m RAM).\r\n  • \u001b[94mgit -C nuttx status -s\u001b[m & \u001b[94mgit -C apps status -s\u001b[m: Both returned empty output (zero modifications).\r\n\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> Please generate a breadboard wiring description for the circuit matching the firmware.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  Provide both a Markdown file with a parts list and wiring description, and a matching SVG diagramming the breadboard\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  circuit.\u001b[m\r"]
