[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[33Agenerated \u001b[94mnuttx/nuttx\u001b[m, \u001b[94mnuttx/nuttx.bin\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mnuttx/nuttx.uf2\u001b[m (\u001b[94m177,232 B\u001b[m FLASH / \u001b[94m13,712 B\u001b[m RAM).\n\u001b[91D\u001b[94mgit -C nuttx status -s\u001b[m & \u001b[94mgit -C apps status -s\u001b[m: Both returned empty output (zero modifications).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m> Please generate a breadboard wiring description for the circuit matching the firmware.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  Provide both a Markdown file with a parts list and wiring description, and a matching SVG diagramming the breadboard\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  circuit.\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 3m 46s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(Initial hypothesis: linking the wiring diagrams enhances the project's documentation. Examini...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(find docs -maxdepth 3)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 3 files \u001b[37m(breadboard-wiring.svg, BREADBOARD_WIRING.md, READM"]
[0.0, "o", "E.md)\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\u001b[66D\u001b[37mxmllint --noout xiao-rp2350-bargraph/breadboard-wiring.svg)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  I have generated both the Markdown breadboard wiring guide and the matching SVG diagram in \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-bargraph/\u001b[m:\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mMarkdown Parts List & Wiring Guide\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd35bf771fb547bf8;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/BREADBOARD_WIRING.md\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/BREADBOARD_WIRING.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[K\n\u001b[75D• Complete Bill of Materials (\u001b[94m10 kΩ\u001b[m linear potentiometer \u001b[94mB10K\u001b[m, 6× \u001b[94m330 Ω\u001b[m resistors, 6× diffused LEDs \u001b[94mLED1\u001b[m–\u001b[94mLED6\u001b[m,\r\n      optional \u001b[94m100 nF\u001b[m wiper bypass capacitor, and 400-tie-point breadboard).\u001b[K\r\n\tFirmware pinout and hardware PWM slice/channel table (\u001b[94mD0/A0\u001b[m -> \u001b[94mGPIO26\u001b[m / \u001b[94m/dev/adc0\u001b[m, \u001b[94mD1\u001b[m -> \u001b[94mGPIO27\u001b[m / \u001b[94mPWM5B\u001b[m, \u001b[94mD2\u001b[m -\r\n\u001b[6C> \u001b[94mGPIO28\u001b[m / \u001b[94mPWM6A\u001b[m, \u001b[94mD3\u001b[m -> \u001b[94mGPIO5\u001b[m / \u001b[94mPWM2B\u001b[m, \u001b[94mD4\u001b[m -> \u001b[94mGPIO6\u001b[m / \u001b[94mPWM3A\u001b[m, \u001b"]
[0.0, "o", "[94mD5\u001b[m -> \u001b[94mGPIO7\u001b[m / \u001b[94mPWM3B\u001b[m, \u001b[94mD6\u001b[m -> \u001b[94mGPIO0\u001b[m / \u001b[94mPWM0A\u001b[m).\r\n\tStep-by-step row/column coordinates (\u001b[94mRows 1–3\u001b[m for the potentiometer, \u001b[94mRows 5–11 Cols E & F\u001b[m for the XIAO RP2350\r\n\u001b[6Cstraddling the center trench, and \u001b[94mRows 14–19\u001b[m for the six \u001b[94m330 Ω\u001b[m resistors and active-high LEDs).\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mSVG Breadboard Circuit Diagram\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkb933534b9c7de9dc;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/breadboard-wiring.svg\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/breadboard-wiring.svg\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (referenced in\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk4844599fc2369361;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/README.md\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/README.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and embedded in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd35bfc71fb548477;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/BREADBOARD_WIRING.md\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/BREADBOARD_WIRING.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m──────────────────────"]
[0.0, "o", "──────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m> Verify `git -C nuttx status -s` and `git -C apps status -s` are clean, stage `xiao-rp2350-bargraph/` and the\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  generated breadboard wiring Markdown and SVG files, and `git commit`.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[33m○\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRunning\u001b[m \u001b[37m(git -C nuttx status -s)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\n\n\n\u001b[51D\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[33A  • \u001b[94mmake -C xiao-rp2350-bargraph test\u001b[m: Passed (\u001b[94mbargraph unit tests passed\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[94mmake -C xiao-rp2350-bargraph\u001b[m: Configured \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-bargraph:bargraph\u001b[m, registered the built-in \u001b[94mbargraph\u001b[m app, and\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  generated \u001b[94mnuttx/nuttx\u001b[m, \u001b[94mnuttx/nuttx.bin\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mnuttx/nuttx.uf2\u001b[m (\u001b[94m177,232 B\u001b[m FLASH / \u001b[94m13,712 B\u001b[m RAM).\r\n  • \u001b[94mgit -C nuttx status -s\u001b[m & \u001b[94mgit -C apps status -s\u001b[m: Both returned empty output (zero modifications).\r\n\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> Please generate a breadboard wiring description for the circuit matching the firmware.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  Provide both a Markdown file with a parts list and wiring description, and a matching SVG diagramming the breadboard\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  circuit.\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 3m 46s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(Initial hy"]
[0.0, "o", "pothesis: linking the wiring diagrams enhances the project's documentation. Examini...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(find docs -maxdepth 3)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 3 files \u001b[37m(breadboard-wiring.svg, BREADBOARD_WIRING.md, README.md)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(xmllint --noout xiao-rp2350-bargraph/breadboard-wiring.svg)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\n  I have generated both the Markdown breadboard wiring guide and the matching SVG diagram in \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-bargraph/\u001b[m:\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mMarkdown Parts List & Wiring Guide\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd35bf771fb547bf8;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/BREADBOARD_WIRING.md\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/BREADBOARD_WIRING.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\u001b[75D• Complete Bill of Materials (\u001b[94m10 kΩ\u001b[m linear potentiometer \u001b[94mB10K\u001b[m, 6× \u001b[94m330 Ω\u001b[m resistors, 6× diffused LEDs \u001b[94mLED1\u001b[m–\u001b[94mLED6\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6Coptional \u001b[94m100 nF\u001b[m wiper bypass capacitor, and 400-tie-point breadboard).\n\u001b[70D• Firmware pinout and hardware PWM sli"]
[0.0, "o", "ce/channel table (\u001b[94mD0/A0\u001b[m -> \u001b[94mGPIO26\u001b[m / \u001b[94m/dev/adc0\u001b[m, \u001b[94mD1\u001b[m -> \u001b[94mGPIO27\u001b[m / \u001b[94mPWM5B\u001b[m, \u001b[94mD2\u001b[m -\r\n\u001b[6C> \u001b[94mGPIO28\u001b[m / \u001b[94mPWM6A\u001b[m, \u001b[94mD3\u001b[m -> \u001b[94mGPIO5\u001b[m / \u001b[94mPWM2B\u001b[m, \u001b[94mD4\u001b[m -> \u001b[94mGPIO6\u001b[m / \u001b[94mPWM3A\u001b[m, \u001b[94mD5\u001b[m -> \u001b[94mGPIO7\u001b[m / \u001b[94mPWM3B\u001b[m, \u001b[94mD6\u001b[m -> \u001b[94mGPIO0\u001b[m / \u001b[94mPWM0A\u001b[m).\r\n\u001b[6C• Step-by-step row/column coordinates (\u001b[94mRows 1–3\u001b[m for the potentiometer, \u001b[94mRows 5–11 Cols E & F\u001b[m for the XIAO RP2350\r\n\u001b[6Cstraddling the center trench, and \u001b[94mRows 14–19\u001b[m for the six \u001b[94m330 Ω\u001b[m resistors and active-high LEDs).\r\n  • \u001b[1mSVG Breadboard Circuit Diagram\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkb933534b9c7de9dc;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/breadboard-wiring.svg\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/breadboard-wiring.svg\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (referenced in\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk4844599fc2369361;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/README.md\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/README.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and embedded in"]
