[0.0, "o", "raddling the center trench, and \u001b[94mRows 14–19\u001b[m for the six \u001b[94m330 Ω\u001b[m resistors and active-high LEDs).\r\n  • \u001b[1mSVG Breadboard Circuit Diagram\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkb933534b9c7de9dc;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/breadboard-wiring.svg\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/breadboard-wiring.svg\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (referenced in\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk4844599fc2369361;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/README.md\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/README.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and embedded in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd35bfc71fb548477;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/BREADBOARD_WIRING.md\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/BREADBOARD_WIRING.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007).\r\n\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> Verify `git -C nuttx status -s` and `git -C apps status -s` are clean, stage `xiao-rp2350-bargraph/` and the\u001b[m\r\n\u001b"]
